    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/68fbb57ac685ce9694ff80d8ab095c38.poster.avif?t=1750957521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/68fbb57ac685ce9694ff80d8ab095c38.webm?t=1750957521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/68fbb57ac685ce9694ff80d8ab095c38.mp4?t=1750957521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/b25d92348d37c73be2715585c4a93ff4.avif?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter epic battles and defend your base from multiple waves of enemies in this tower-defense where strategy and luck coincide. Place Towers, upgrade them, plant crystal mines, sell them and manage your resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/1cac4ca384f62392bb14ac0557b7e186.poster.avif?t=1750957521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/1cac4ca384f62392bb14ac0557b7e186.webm?t=1750957521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Protect your base from threats! Place Towers to defeat them and earn gold. Each wave of enemies will get tougher and tougher\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/cc610aca786eefde84dd873073507979.webp?t=1750957521\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/50ce0fd74df7a3242dcc884727c61e5f.poster.avif?t=1750957521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/50ce0fd74df7a3242dcc884727c61e5f.webm?t=1750957521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fuse two Towers of the same tier to generate a random Tower from the next tier. Continue merging to get new abilities and greater stats! But careful, the randomness will force you to adapt to the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/cc610aca786eefde84dd873073507979.webp?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/a01fda5839ff25ede8f3134491ef6974.poster.avif?t=1750957521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/a01fda5839ff25ede8f3134491ef6974.webm?t=1750957521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant crystal mines to boost your Towers, get crystals, and (if luck is on your side,) sell them at a good price. The value of the crystals fluctuates with every wave of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/cc610aca786eefde84dd873073507979.webp?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/86c67efa5387ad63709eb4879ebe9226.poster.avif?t=1750957521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/86c67efa5387ad63709eb4879ebe9226.webm?t=1750957521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a glorious Victory, get battle EXP, Royal crystals and Royal coins. Invest your gains in new Towers to help with your next battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/cc610aca786eefde84dd873073507979.webp?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/3182077decbc6cc2ea490226f077a96e.avif?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy 10 levels of challenging resource management and wave-based combat, each with 4 different difficulty settings! More levels, enemies, Towers and content will be made available through DLC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/cc610aca786eefde84dd873073507979.webp?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/0ca6c2868ff2aae429bd74793b40f746.avif?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bigger variety of Towers and enemies: More variety means more strategic options; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional content: Purchasing the DLC grants access to more content and helps support the game;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rankings and achievements: Get the best performance in battle and rise in the ranks to show your strategic prowess; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades and adjustments: </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are refining the game in every aspect to ensure a fair and challenging experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/68fbb57ac685ce9694ff80d8ab095c38.poster.avif?t=1750957521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/68fbb57ac685ce9694ff80d8ab095c38.webm?t=1750957521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/68fbb57ac685ce9694ff80d8ab095c38.mp4?t=1750957521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/b25d92348d37c73be2715585c4a93ff4.avif?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter epic battles and defend your base from multiple waves of enemies in this tower-defense where strategy and luck coincide. Place Towers, upgrade them, plant crystal mines, sell them and manage your resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/1cac4ca384f62392bb14ac0557b7e186.poster.avif?t=1750957521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/1cac4ca384f62392bb14ac0557b7e186.webm?t=1750957521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Protect your base from threats! Place Towers to defeat them and earn gold. Each wave of enemies will get tougher and tougher\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/cc610aca786eefde84dd873073507979.webp?t=1750957521\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/50ce0fd74df7a3242dcc884727c61e5f.poster.avif?t=1750957521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/50ce0fd74df7a3242dcc884727c61e5f.webm?t=1750957521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fuse two Towers of the same tier to generate a random Tower from the next tier. Continue merging to get new abilities and greater stats! But careful, the randomness will force you to adapt to the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/cc610aca786eefde84dd873073507979.webp?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/a01fda5839ff25ede8f3134491ef6974.poster.avif?t=1750957521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/a01fda5839ff25ede8f3134491ef6974.webm?t=1750957521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant crystal mines to boost your Towers, get crystals, and (if luck is on your side,) sell them at a good price. The value of the crystals fluctuates with every wave of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/cc610aca786eefde84dd873073507979.webp?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/86c67efa5387ad63709eb4879ebe9226.poster.avif?t=1750957521\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/86c67efa5387ad63709eb4879ebe9226.webm?t=1750957521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a glorious Victory, get battle EXP, Royal crystals and Royal coins. Invest your gains in new Towers to help with your next battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/cc610aca786eefde84dd873073507979.webp?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/3182077decbc6cc2ea490226f077a96e.avif?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy 10 levels of challenging resource management and wave-based combat, each with 4 different difficulty settings! More levels, enemies, Towers and content will be made available through DLC</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/cc610aca786eefde84dd873073507979.webp?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679470/extras/0ca6c2868ff2aae429bd74793b40f746.avif?t=1750957521\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bigger variety of Towers and enemies: More variety means more strategic options; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additional content: Purchasing the DLC grants access to more content and helps support the game;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rankings and achievements: Get the best performance in battle and rise in the ranks to show your strategic prowess; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades and adjustments: </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are refining the game in every aspect to ensure a fair and challenging experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
